; question-sentence signal words for count direction.
; "how many are left" → kshaya (subtraction expected)
; "how many in total" → vriddhi (addition expected)
; 
; distinct from common-sense-events (premise verbs).
; these are question-level intent signals.

(kosha count-signals
  (sthita common-sense-varga)
  (yukta kshaya vriddhi))
